 ],
 "subtitles": [
  {
   "t0": 3.86,
   "t1": 5.227,
   "text": "This is Lear Local."
  },
  {
   "t0": 5.227,
   "t1": 9.111,
   "text": "A backend-only RAG agent that answers questions about the Lear backend,"
  },
  {
   "t0": 9.111,
   "t1": 10.67,
   "text": "built for the take-home brief,"
  },
  {
   "t0": 10.67,
   "t1": 12.732,
   "text": "where every claim is traced to source,"
  },
  {
   "t0": 12.732,
   "t1": 14.09,
   "text": "and every number is measured."
  },
  {
   "t0": 16.118,
   "t1": 18.087,
   "text": "The brief has three parts."
  },
  {
   "t0": 18.087,
   "t1": 20.242,
   "text": "An accurate knowledge base."
  },
  {
   "t0": 20.242,
   "t1": 24.661,
   "text": "A local agent with sessions, memory and guardrails."
  },
  {
   "t0": 24.661,
   "t1": 30.433,
   "text": "And measurement, with an evaluation set and three rounds of improvement."
  },
  {
   "t0": 30.433,
   "t1": 32.298,
   "text": "Here is how each part is met."
  },
  {
   "t0": 34.473,
   "t1": 35.415,
   "text": "Part one:"
  },
  {
   "t0": 35.415,
   "t1": 37.005,
   "text": "the knowledge base."
  },
  {
   "t0": 37.005,
   "t1": 42.122,
   "text": "The documentation is generated straight from the Lear backend at one pinned commit:"
  },
  {
   "t0": 42.122,
   "t1": 44.744,
   "text": "four hundred fifty-four source files,"
  },
  {
   "t0": 44.744,
   "t1": 48.484,
   "text": "eighty-seven API routes, thirty-eight environment variables,"
  },
  {
   "t0": 48.484,
   "t1": 50.544,
   "text": "and seventy-nine modules."
  },
  {
   "t0": 50.544,
   "t1": 53.962,
   "text": "A verifier checks every claim against the source code:"
  },
  {
   "t0": 53.962,
   "t1": 56.682,
   "text": "three hundred forty out of three hundred forty,"
  },
  {
   "t0": 56.682,
   "t1": 59.399,
   "text": "with eleven of eleven checks passing."
  },
  {
   "t0": 59.399,
   "t1": 63.874,
   "text": "The markdown is then split by heading into three hundred fifty-five chunks,"
  },
  {
   "t0": 63.874,
   "t1": 67.373,
   "text": "embedded, and stored in a SQLite vector index."
  },
  {
   "t0": 69.413,
   "t1": 70.216,
   "text": "Part two:"
  },
  {
   "t0": 70.216,
   "t1": 71.42,
   "text": "the agent."
  },
  {
   "t0": 71.42,
   "t1": 78.344,
   "text": "Ask a question in the CLI, and retrieval runs dense vectors and BM25 side by side,"
  },
  {
   "t0": 78.344,
   "t1": 81.547,
   "text": "fuses them with reciprocal rank fusion,"
  },
  {
   "t0": 81.547,
   "t1": 84.885,
   "text": "then reranks and diversifies."
  },
  {
   "t0": 84.885,
   "t1": 88.889,
   "text": "The best chunks fill an eighteen-hundred-token context budget,"
  },
  {
   "t0": 88.889,
   "t1": 91.167,
   "text": "and the answer cites its evidence,"
  },
  {
   "t0": 91.167,
   "t1": 94.168,
   "text": "traced back to exact lines of Lear source."
  },
  {
   "t0": 94.168,
   "t1": 98.783,
   "text": "Sessions persist, long histories are compacted,"
  },
  {
   "t0": 98.783,
   "t1": 101.427,
   "text": "memory is scoped to each user,"
  },
  {
   "t0": 101.427,
   "t1": 104.779,
   "text": "and guardrails refuse out-of-scope questions,"
  },
  {
   "t0": 104.779,
   "t1": 109.606,
   "text": "strip invented citations, quarantine injected instructions,"
  },
  {
   "t0": 109.606,
   "t1": 111.283,
   "text": "and rate-limit abuse."
  },
  {
   "t0": 113.307,
   "t1": 114.337,
   "text": "Part three:"
  },
  {
   "t0": 114.337,
   "t1": 117.492,
   "text": "measurement, where most of the work went."
  },
  {
   "t0": 117.492,
   "t1": 122.013,
   "text": "Every request is timed across thirteen lifecycle stages."
  },
  {
   "t0": 122.013,
   "t1": 127.76,
   "text": "A load test with one to ten dummy users reports time to first token,"
  },
  {
   "t0": 127.76,
   "t1": 133.12,
   "text": "inter-token latency, tokens per second, mean, p50, p85 and p99."
  },
  {
   "t0": 133.12,
   "t1": 138.192,
   "text": "At ten users the pipeline sustains thirty-two requests per second,"
  },
  {
   "t0": 138.192,
   "t1": 142.923,
   "text": "and the rate limiter admits ten requests and blocks ten."
  },
  {
   "t0": 142.923,
   "t1": 146.765,
   "text": "The evaluation set has eighty questions with golden answers,"
  },
  {
   "t0": 146.765,
   "t1": 149.763,
   "text": "scored on citations, groundedness,"
  },
  {
   "t0": 149.763,
   "t1": 153.165,
   "text": "answer relevance, context precision and context recall."
  },
  {
   "t0": 153.165,
   "t1": 160.516,
   "text": "Three evaluate-and-improve rounds lifted correctness from forty-five to fifty-five percent,"
  },
  {
   "t0": 160.516,
   "t1": 163.687,
   "text": "with zero regressions, and the holdout,"
  },
  {
   "t0": 163.687,
   "t1": 167.217,
   "text": "used exactly once, scored sixty-four percent."
  },
  {
   "t0": 169.216,
   "t1": 171.378,
   "text": "And here is what we refuse to fake."
  },
  {
   "t0": 171.378,
   "t1": 174.721,
   "text": "Ollama could not be installed in the recording sandbox,"
  },
  {
   "t0": 174.721,
   "t1": 178.334,
   "text": "so every number you just saw comes from the offline baseline,"
  },
  {
   "t0": 178.334,
   "t1": 182.721,
   "text": "labelled not qualifying, and the judge scores are deterministic proxies."
  },
  {
   "t0": 182.721,
   "t1": 185.564,
   "text": "The local models are configured,"
  },
  {
   "t0": 185.564,
   "t1": 189.304,
   "text": "the doctor enforces the brief's size limits the moment Ollama runs,"
  },
  {
   "t0": 189.304,
   "t1": 192.706,
   "text": "and the full qualification run is eight documented steps away."
  },
  {
   "t0": 194.704,
   "t1": 196.58,
   "text": "Everything is runnable."
  },
  {
   "t0": 196.58,
   "t1": 200.819,
   "text": "One command replays the recorded run on any machine,"
  },
  {
   "t0": 200.819,
   "t1": 205.371,
   "text": "and the code, the evidence and this video are one click away."
  },
  {
   "t0": 205.371,
   "t1": 206.67,
   "text": "Lear Local:"
  },
  {
   "t0": 206.67,
   "t1": 210.964,
   "text": "every claim traced, every number measured, nothing faked."
  }
 ]
}